cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PrismAPI in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "PrismAPI"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Nasser"
    given-names: "Gerard"
version: 0.1.0-beta.1
date-released: "2026-08-16"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gerardnasser/PRISMA-App"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  A desktop application for running PRISMA-2020-compliant systematic
  reviews and meta-analyses locally: field-aware configuration, search
  capture, deduplication, dual-reviewer screening with inter-rater
  reliability, extraction, risk-of-bias assessment, and a
  content-addressed project exchange format.
